cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "ICU vital-sign record density: source-stream and site-level variation"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a retrospective data-quality study of vital-sign record
  density across MIMIC-IV and eICU-CRD, decomposing variance by data stream,
  database, contributing site and care unit. Version 1.1.0 adds the revision
  analyses: a plausibility-restricted primary cohort, a threshold sweep across
  observation floors, a fitted negative-binomial generalized linear mixed model
  for the count outcome, duplicate-timestamp and covariate-missingness checks,
  excluded-stay characterisation, and entry-order sensitivity.
